flowchart TD
    GATE[GATE CS Exam Strategy] --> S[Strategy Phases]
    GATE --> T[Time Management]
    GATE --> R[Resources]

    S --> P1[Phase 1: Foundation<br/>Months 1-4]
    P1 --> P1A[Core Subjects: DS, Algo, OS, CN, DBMS]
    P1 --> P1B[Mathematics: DM, Calculus, Probability]
    P1 --> P1C[Standard Textbooks]

    S --> P2[Phase 2: Advanced<br/>Months 5-7]
    P2 --> P2A[Theory Subjects: CO, CD, TOC]
    P2 --> P2B[Solve Previous Year Papers]
    P2 --> P2C[Topic-wise Mock Tests]

    S --> P3[Phase 3: Revision<br/>Months 8-9]
    P3 --> P3A[Full-Length Mock Tests]
    P3 --> P3A1[Analyze Weak Areas]
    P3 --> P3B[Revise Formulas & Shortcuts]
    P3 --> P3C[Time Management Practice]

    T --> T1[1.5 min per question avg]
    T --> T2[Easy questions first]
    T --> T3[Mark & skip hard ones]

    R --> R1[Core: CLRS, Tanenbaum, Silberschatz]
    R --> R2[Practice: GATE PYQs, Test Series]
    R --> R3[YouTube: Standard Playlists]
